    "innovation": "This paper synthesizes recent research with original analysis to demonstrate a robust negative trend in Northern Hemisphere maximum seasonal snow depth, snow cover extent, and snow water equivalent for the 1961-2015 period, largely consistent with the expected effects of global warming.",
